d</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProductForcingStructure}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ProductForcingStructure}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (fully explicit product-poset predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProductForcing}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcForcingProductForcing}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ProductForcing}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcForcingProductForcing}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (compatibility projections defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}product\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}explicit} \\vdash \\mathrm{ProductForcingStructure}_S(\\mathbb R,R_{\\mathbb R},\\mathbb P,R_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb Q,R_{\\mathbb Q})\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,R_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb Q,R_{\\mathbb Q})\\land\\mathbb R=\\mathbb P\\times\\mathbb Q\\land R_{\\mathbb R}=\\{\\langle\\langle p,q\\rangle,\\langle p&#39;,q&#39;\\rangle\\rangle\\in\\mathbb R\\times\\mathbb R:\\langle p,p&#39;\\rangle\\in R_{\\mathbb P}\\land\\langle q,q&#39;\\rangle\\in R_{\\mathbb Q}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}product\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}explicit} \\vdash \\mathrm{ProductForcingStructure}_S(\\mathbb R,R_{\\mathbb R},\\mathbb P,R_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb Q,R_{\\mathbb Q})\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,R_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb Q,R_{\\mathbb Q})\\land\\mathbb R=\\mathbb P\\times\\mathbb Q\\land R_{\\mathbb R}=\\{\\langle\\langle p,q\\rangle,\\langle p&#39;,q&#39;\\rangle\\rangle\\in\\mathbb R\\times\\mathbb R:\\langle p,p&#39;\\rangle\\in R_{\\mathbb P}\\land\\langle q,q&#39;\\rangle\\in R_{\\mathbb Q}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equati